<title>USA: NYSE UNAVAILABLES - Allergan Inc and Harte-Hanks Communications Inc.</title>
<headline>NYSE UNAVAILABLES - Allergan Inc and Harte-Hanks Communications Inc.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said on Wednesday that Allergan Inc and Harte-Hanks Communications Inc were unavailable for after-hours trading due to news.</p>
<p>Also unavailable were Corimon SACA and Edison Brothers Stores Inc.</p>
</text>
